Changes:

- Updated `.github/workflows/validate-release.yml` so `opensandbox-integration` generates the official Docker-mode config with `opensandbox/server:v0.2.1@sha256:a41670fa956864f116b9db696bd8d0781b6c709be9cac1e66e2981740b1fbeb4 init-config /config/sandbox.toml --example docker --force`.
- Patched generated config in CI to bind `server.host` to `0.0.0.0` and set `docker.host_ip = "host.docker.internal"` for server-in-container access to Docker-published sandbox ports.
