- Added `--add-host host.docker.internal:host-gateway`, `DOCKER_HOST=unix:///var/run/docker.sock`, and `OPENSANDBOX_INSECURE_SERVER=YES`.
- Pre-pulled pinned sandbox image `opensandbox/code-interpreter:v1.1.0@sha256:133a3c1720dd52291a019740c2987e7164ea6de79e23d8198798e58950ae2e6e`.
